# Context Passport — Code Owners
#
# This file defines who is automatically requested for review on pull requests.
#
# No individual is listed here. Context Passport is a CC0 specification and is
# not owned by a person or a company; listing a single personal account as the
# owner of GOVERNANCE.md said the opposite of what the project is.
#
# Stewardship is described in GOVERNANCE.md. When a maintainer group exists as
# a GitHub team, add it here as @contextpassport/<team> — an entry naming a
# team that does not exist makes the whole file invalid, so this stays empty
# until then.
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-configuration/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
